       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Can't, in short: 못",
     "texto": [
      "There is a shorter form: **못** in front of the verb. **못 가요** = I can't go. **못 먹어요** = I can't eat.",
      "Compare: **안** 가요 = I'm not going (I don't want to, or it's not scheduled). **못** 가요 = I can't go.",
      "With 해요: **못해요** = I can't; I'm not good at it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Well, yet, quickly",
     "texto": [
      "**잘** = well. **잘해요** = is good at it. **잘 못해요** = not very good at it.",
      "**아직** = yet. **빨리** = quickly.",
      "In front of a noun, «spicy» is **매운**: 매운 음식 = spicy food."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
